          "concern": "The same stored OAuth grant may list its scopes in another order, or contain more scopes than the caller requests.",
          "response": "The author states that order is irrelevant when all required scopes are present. tobyp explicitly accepts without inline requests; removal of the D217668 parent relationship is not a test result.",
